# Allowlist: the daemon image needs only the Python packages and their
# metadata. Everything else (secrets/, .env, data/, artifacts/, node_modules,
# experiment outputs) stays out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!atn/
!nodes/
!bridge/
!world_model/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
# bridge/node_modules is a dev install (800+ MB); the wheel ships only the .ts sources.
**/node_modules
